<title>JAPAN: Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Fuji.</title>
<headline>Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Fuji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Thursday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Fuji Co Ltd, a regional chain store operator.</p>
<p>Fuji is likely to be listed on the first section of the TSE on August 1, the TSE said.</p>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said last week that it would shift Fuji to its first section on August 1 from the second section where its shares are now traded.</p>
